{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1782057087789,"sessionID":"ses_1152755b8ffe3Q2F0uDJU6rwfc","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"tool_UnTxJeK0MH9BDAEBhojHMWIU","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/yt/task/pc-lib-analysis/runs/python-mss/2026-06-21T15-42-06-494Z/report.json","content":"{
  "library": {
    "name": "python-mss",
    "package_name": "mss",
    "source_url": "https://github.com/BoboTiG/python-mss",
    "analyzed_at": "2026-06-21T15:42:06.494Z",
    "commit": "d7a906492c37cd81672f64ca2d7253f85c9dee9f",
    "one_liner": "纯 Python 跨平台截屏库，通过 ctypes 调用 Windows/macOS/Linux 原生图形 API 捕获屏幕像素并输出 PNG。",
    "ecosystem": "python",
    "bindings": []
  },
  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "python-mss（mss）是一个无第三方运行时依赖的纯 Python 截屏库。它对外暴露统一的 MSS 接口，在运行时根据 platform.system() 选择对应后端：Windows 使用 GDI32/User32，macOS 使用 CoreGraphics，GNU/Linux 使用 XCB（默认，含 MIT-SHM 加速与 XGetImage 回退）或遗留 Xlib。除截图外，还提供多显示器枚举、鼠标光标合成、BGRA→RGB 转换、PNG 编码与命令行工具，常用于计算机视觉、自动化测试与游戏辅助场景。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "屏幕截图捕获",
        "description": "按显示器或自定义矩形区域抓取屏幕像素，底层分别调用 Win32 BitBlt/CreateDIBSection、macOS CGWindowListCreateImage、Linux XCB XGetImage/XShmGetImage。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/mss/windows/gdi.py:359-406",
          "src/mss/darwin.py:227-265",
          "src/mss/linux/xshmgetimage.py:145-191",
          "src/mss/linux/base.py:427-467"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "多显示器枚举",
        "description": "枚举物理/逻辑显示器及其几何位置、主屏标记、输出名称与 EDID 信息，Windows 用 EnumDisplayMonitors，macOS 用 CGGetActiveDisplayList，Linux 用 XRandR。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/mss/windows/gdi.py:270-342",
          "src/mss/darwin.py:176-225",
          "src/mss/linux/base.py:138-178"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "鼠标光标捕获",
        "description": "在 GNU/Linux 上通过 XFixes 扩展读取当前光标图像，并与屏幕截图 alpha 混合；Windows 与 macOS 后端暂不支持。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/mss/linux/base.py:394-425",
          "src/mss/linux/xlib.py:613-642",
          "src/mss/base.py:440-486"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "图像格式转换与数组接口",
        "description": "将后端返回的 BGRx 原始字节转换为 RGB、BGRA 或像素元组列表，并提供 __array_interface__ 以兼容 NumPy、OpenCV、PyTorch 等库。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/mss/screenshot.py:55-158"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "PNG 编码与文件保存",
        "description": "使用 Python 标准库 struct/zlib 手写 PNG（IHDR/IDAT/IEND）编码，支持压缩级别，并通过 MSS.save()/shot() 直接落盘。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/mss/tools.py:145-198",
          "src/mss/base.py:384-438"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "命令行工具",
        "description": "提供 `mss` 入口脚本，支持指定显示器、区域坐标、输出文件名、PNG 压缩级别与后端选择。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/mss/__main__.py:32-117",
          "pyproject.toml:68-69"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "graphics",
    "target_users": "Python 开发者、计算机视觉/自动化测试/游戏辅助工具开发者，以及需要在不同桌面平台快速截图的终端用户。"
  },
